  "notes": [
    "MiniMax-H3-Turbo is an alias: MachGen's messages name it MiniMax-H3-MultiMax.",
    "Wan2.2-A14B resolves to Wan2.2-T2V-A14B for T2V and Wan2.2-I2V-A14B for I2V.",
    "MiniMax-H3 and MiniMax-H3-Turbo list 1080 among allowed heights, but a 1080p request returns 403 'not available for your account' (the contract marks 1080 a private height) and the pricebook has no 1080p row.",
    "An I2V request with an end frame validates against the same grid as a single-image I2V request (MiniMax-H3 lists 1-30 s for both).",
    "MachGen also accepts task_type F2F for end-frame models (LTX-2.3-Pro lists ['F2F', 'I2V', 'T2V']); the docs name I2V with a second image as the documented form.",
    "The 2026-10-25 contract caps MiniMax-H3 1440p at 15 s (highResMaxDuration), but the grid check lists 1-30 s at 1440p; that cap was not observed in a 400."
  ]
